, `doc`, `slides`\n\n### Move Node\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"move\", \"space_id\": \"7xxx\", \"node_token\": \"wikcnXXX\" }\n```\n\nTo different location:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"move\",\n  \"space_id\": \"7xxx\",\n  \"node_token\": \"wikcnXXX\",\n  \"target_space_id\": \"7yyy\",\n  \"target_parent_token\": \"wikcnYYY\"\n}\n```\n\n### Rename Node\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"rename\", \"space_id\": \"7xxx\", \"node_token\": \"wikcnXXX\", \"title\": \"New Title\" }\n```\n\n## Wiki-Doc Workflow\n\nTo edit a wiki page:\n\n1. Get node: `{ \"action\": \"get\", \"token\": \"***\" }` → returns `obj_token`\n2. Read doc: `feishu_doc { \"action\": \"read\", \"doc_token\": \"obj_token\" }`\n3. Write doc: `feishu_doc { \"action\": \"write\", \"doc_token\": \"obj_token\", \"content\": \"...\" }`\n\n## Configuration\n\n```yaml\nchannels:\n  feishu:\n    tools:\n      wiki: true # default: true\n      doc: true # required - wiki content uses feishu_doc\n```\n\n**Dependency:** This tool requires `feishu_doc` to be enabled. Wiki pages are documents - use `feishu_wiki` to navigate, then `feishu_doc` to read/edit content.\n\n## Permissions\n\nRequired: `wiki:wiki` or `wiki:wiki:readonly`\n"}],"toolCallId":"call_function_1k5hmvigpszc_1","toolName":"read","isError":false},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to find the current 飞书 table structure to understand the fields. Let me use the feishu-wiki or some feishu tool to get the table metadata. But I notice the user mentioned the table has a \"单选\" field for 1688 main image. \n\nActually, wait - looking at the context again:\n\n\"单选，可以尝试改为1688的主图\" - The user is saying the \"单选\" field (radio selection) could be changed to use the 1688 main image.\n\nAnd \"状态默认的都是都是待审批哈\" - The status defaults to \"待审批\" (pending approval).\n \nSo the user wants me to write data to the 飞书 table at https://my.feishu.cn/base/AKppbAeyXanToTsVl6ScxO5QnZd, where the attachment field gets renamed to use the TikTok produ